   "title": "当前做法与问题",
   "html": "<div class='callout'><p><b>专业问题：</b>面波和随机噪声叠加，过度滤波也会损伤反射。</p><p><b>输入资料：</b>合成含噪道集、视速度与奇异值谱。</p><p><b>服务目标：</b>分阶段压制相干噪声与随机噪声。</p></div><svg viewBox='0 0 720 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='炮集上三类波的成分示意'><text x='20' y='20' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>一炮记录 = 有效反射 + 面波 + 随机噪声</text><line x1='44' y1='34' x2='44' y2='200' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='44' y1='200' x2='460' y2='200' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2'/><polygon points='44,34 66,34 244,200 156,200' fill='#d47a3a' fill-opacity='.14'/><line x1='52' y1='34' x2='218' y2='200' stroke='#d47a3a' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='80' y1='34' x2='246' y2='200' stroke='#d47a3a' stroke-width='1.4' opacity='.7'/><path d='M44,80 C120,76 220,84 320,79 C390,76 430,82 460,80' fill='none' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M44,125 C110,122 210,128 320,124 C390,121 430,127 460,125' fill='none' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-width='1.4' opacity='.85'/><path d='M44,168 C120,165 230,171 340,167 C400,164 436,169 460,167' fill='none' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-width='1.4' opacity='.85'/><text x='466' y='84' font-size='9' fill='#2875c7'>拉平后的有效反射</text><text x='96' y='52' font-size='9' fill='#d47a3a' font-weight='600'>面波：低频 强能量 视速度低</text><circle cx='300' cy='60' r='.9' fill='#9ba3a9' opacity='.55'/><circle cx='330' cy='92' r='.9' fill='#9ba3a9' opacity='.55'/><circle cx='366' cy='74' r='.9' fill='#9ba3a9' opacity='.55'/><circle cx='402' cy='110' r='.9' fill='#9ba3a9' opacity='.55'/><circle cx='288' cy='140' r='.9' fill='#9ba3a9' opacity='.55'/><circle cx='352' cy='150' r='.9' fill='#9ba3a9' opacity='.55'/><circle cx='412' cy='66' r='.9' fill='#9ba3a9' opacity='.55'/><circle cx='428' cy='170' r='.9' fill='#9ba3a9' opacity='.55'/><circle cx='306' cy='180' r='.9' fill='#9ba3a9' opacity='.55'/><circle cx='382' cy='132' r='.9' fill='#9ba3a9' opacity='.55'/><circle cx='270' cy='104' r='.9' fill='#9ba3a9' opacity='.55'/><circle cx='438' cy='94' r='.9' fill='#9ba3a9' opacity='.55'/><path d='M368,58 q3,5 0,10 q-3,5 0,10 q3,5 0,10 q-3,5 0,10 q3,5 0,10' fill='none' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='1.1'/><text x='380' y='66' font-size='8.5' fill='#41699b'>工业干扰 50 Hz</text><text x='46' y='216' font-size='9.5' fill='#52627a'>炮集记录（时间 × 道号）</text><text x='300' y='216' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b'>随机噪声：全频带不相干</text><path d='M505,148 C530,146 545,70 560,66 C575,70 590,146 615,148 Z' fill='#d47a3a' fill-opacity='.2' stroke='#d47a3a' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M505,148 C540,144 555,88 590,84 C625,88 655,140 690,148 Z' fill='#2875c7' fill-opacity='.18' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='505' y1='148' x2='690' y2='148' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='549' y1='148' x2='549' y2='152' stroke='#9ba3a9'/><line x1='594' y1='148' x2='594' y2='152' stroke='#9ba3a9'/><line x1='638' y1='148' x2='638' y2='152' stroke='#9ba3a9'/><line x1='690' y1='148' x2='690' y2='152' stroke='#9ba3a9'/><text x='549' y='162' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='monospace'>30</text><text x='594' y='162' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='monospace'>60</text><text x='638' y='162' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='monospace'>90</text><text x='690' y='162' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='monospace'>125</text><text x='597' y='174' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b' text-anchor='middle'>频率 (Hz)</text><text x='505' y='40' font-size='9' fill='#d47a3a'>面波：能量挤在 30 Hz 以下</text><text x='505' y='56' font-size='9' fill='#2875c7'>反射：20—80 Hz 频带</text><text x='505' y='72' font-size='9' fill='#64748b'>随机：铺满全频带</text><text x='360' y='238' font-size='9.5' fill='#52627a' text-anchor='middle'>三者可分性 = 去噪的全部依据：频率 + 视速度 + 相干性</text></svg><div class='figcap'><b>专业原理示意</b><span>用于解释业务概念和空间、参数关系；图中数字与对照为教学示意，不是现场成果。</span></div>"
